PUBLISHED FEDERATION DATA

This repository contains records, classification standards, weight-class
definitions and rule details published by powerlifting federations. Those are
facts about what a federation has published, independently encoded here from
publicly available sources. They are not copies of any federation's pages,
tables, artwork or software, and no federation has reviewed, approved,
sponsored or endorsed this project.

Provenance for each dataset -- what was read, when it was retrieved, and how it
was transcribed -- is recorded in data/sources/ and in the published artifact
metadata. Federation names and marks belong to their respective owners and are
used here only to say factually whose rules a number came from.

